<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ameristar Casinos cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ameristar Casinos cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said analyst David Anders lowered his recommendation on Ameristar Casinos Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 to 6-3/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
